    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d670">

                <pb facs="0817" n="531" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg531"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Laughlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-11T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 11, 1916, 5 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3663. Your 4695 August 10, 6 p. m. You are directed to informally acquaint
                    Foreign Office that the Department will be pleased to have it grant Wyvell
                    hearings for the purpose of discussing unofficially for reconsideration all
                    individual meritorious cases in which previous adverse decisions have been
                    rendered, and in addition thereto reserving the right to discuss unofficially
                    all individual cases now pending in which no decision has as yet been
                    rendered.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
